Z||000000||JohnnyK||12-20-2000||11:36 PM||||Me and my buddy were stopped at a stop light in my 85 4cyl..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Anyways, theres a mini van beside us with a younger kid, so I gun it and so does he. It's dead even until I hit 4th, and the moment I do, he's taking off on me. Anyways, I'm stupider (faster?) so in the twisty small streets I'm gaining on him, downshift, and the damn car spins out (this is at about 90kmh?) and the freakin mirror falls off and konks me! Needless to say, I didn't win..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
