Z||000012||Pontiaddict||12-22-2000||01:27 AM||||I didn't think Minivans came out until 1985.<BR>As for minivans being sleepers.<BR>In Autoweek (I think) there was a guy with a new Dodge Caravan. It was the short, base model with the big 6 swapped in with some mods. It also had some suspension work and Viper front brakes with rear disks off one of the bigger Dodge cars. Anyway, it was at Chrysler's fun day or whatever that had employees race their cars on a road course. Well, the minivan was right on this new Camaro's butt and the Camaro couldn't lose him.||||reg||1
